OL,3,GNEWSAMother 'blanked' over road safety
OL,4,Apleas after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has said she feels "blanked"
OL,7,Fby a council over her calls for road
OL,8,Fsafety improvements in a town centre
OL,9,Fwhere her son was killed when he was
OL,10,Fhit by a van.
OL,12,FSamuel Wilson, 26, died in December
OL,13,F2023 in Ilkeston, Derbyshire, when Zac
OL,14,FNewman drove a van into a group in
OL,15,FMarket Place. He was later convicted of
OL,16,Fmurder.
OL,18,FNearly three years on, Loraine Wilson
OL,19,Fsaid nothing had changed at the
OL,20,Flocation despite a campaign and
OL,21,Fpetition to improve what she calls
OL,22,F"basic safety measures".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
