OL,3,GNEWSAMother 'blanked' over road safety
OL,4,Apleas after murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire County Council said it did
OL,7,Fnot wish to comment on any plans for
OL,8,Fthe area before speaking to the family,
OL,9,Fwhich it expects to do in the coming
OL,10,Fdays.
